<title>USA: U.S. stockpile rejects MC ferro-manganese offer.</title>
<headline>U.S. stockpile rejects MC ferro-manganese offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. stockpile said it rejected all offers for medium carbon ferro-manganese.</p>
<p>The stockpile also said its offering of ferro-manganese scheduled for December 24 has been cancelled. The next offering will be held on January 28, 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
